<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's JSE sets record 1,277 bln rand mkt cap.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's JSE sets record 1,277 bln rand mkt cap.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Wednesday that a record 1,277 billion rand market capitalisation was recorded on the exchange on July 15.</p>
<p>A previous high of 1,275 billion rand was recorded on July 2.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
